  &lt;img class=&apos;gatsby-resp-image-image&apos; alt=&apos;프레임워크 비교 (출처: Reddit)&apos; title=&apos;&apos; src=&apos;/static/5a27853b7e1cd6bc80418b73522c7956/a22ce/%EB%B9%84%EA%B5%90.jpg&apos; srcset=&apos;/static/5a27853b7e1cd6bc80418b73522c7956/0b705/%EB%B9%84%EA%B5%90.jpg 170w,
